\n    bucket it closes with `Bucket: <slug>`, and spec-gate refuses a slug\n    attest/buckets.md does not list before any criterion runs. buckets.md\n    lists the five buckets from the 2026-09-27 convergence ruling.\n    \n    Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n .github/workflows/ci.yml        | 12 +++------\n attavo.toml                     |  2 +-\n attavo/cli.py                   | 16 +++++++++---\n attavo/spec.py                  | 47 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-\n attest/buckets.md               | 16 ++++++++++++\n tests/test_ci_inherit.py        |  6 ++++-\n tests/test_cli_help.py          | 11 +++++++++\n tests/test_doctor.py            |  6 +++++\n tests/test_own_records_guard.py | 54 ++++++++++++++++++++---------------------\n tests/test_self_tenancy.py      | 48 +++++++++++++++---------------------\n tests/test_spec_gate.py         | 48 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n 11 files changed, 194 insertions(+), 72 deletions(-)","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
