{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VM1pmZWqVyczxKxFqwsrYd","type":"tool_result","content":"commit 3418772d643654b00471e767969242c88a42c314\nAuthor: attavo executor (claude-code) <executor+claude-code@attavo.invalid>\nDate:   Sun Sep 27 14:42:36 2026 -0600\n\n    own_records marker replaces the three hand-copied deselect lists (#237)\n    \n    Item #229 build-04's fourth attempt failed because select-tests mapped a\n    common.py/build.py change to the whole suite and the gate ran\n    test_no_invocation_lacks_record, which read build-04's own .started\n    marker as a dead invocation. That test was one of the seven doctor tests\n    that read this repository's own records, told apart from the rest of the\n    suite by three hand-copied --deselect lists that stayed in sync only by\n    convention -- and the list was missing it.\n    \n    @pytest.mark.own_records already existed and already had a guard\n    (test_own_records_guard.py) enforcing that every test reading this\n    repository's own records carries it. This closes the gap: the six\n    doctor tests gain the marker, [tests].run and ci.yml's full-suite step\n    become `-m 'not own_records'`, the doctor job and the inherit path run\n    `-m own_records`, every --deselect and DESELECT_FLAGS list is gone, and\n    the guard's exemption for the doctor tests goes with it.\n    \n    Also lands the bucket line: a fix item's spec names the root-cause\n    bucket it closes with `Bucket: <slug>`, and spec-gate refuses a slug\n    attest/buckets.md does not list before any criterion runs. buckets.md\n    lists the five buckets from the 2026-09-27 convergence ruling.\n    \n    Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\ndiff --git a/.github/workflows/ci.yml b/.github/workflows/ci.yml\nindex 70a96ac..a7780b7 100644\n--- a/.github/workflows/ci.yml\n+++ b/.github/workflows/ci.yml\n@@ -51,13 +51,7 @@ jobs:\n       - name: pytest\n         if: steps.inherit.outputs.inherit != 'true'\n         run: >\n-          python3 -m pytest tests -q --durations=5\n-          --deselect tests/test_doctor.py::test_every_gate_rejects\n-          --deselect tests/test_doctor.py::test_one_item_traversed_every_stage\n-          --deselect tests/test_doctor.py::test_no_commit_lacks_a_record\n-          --deselect tests/test_doctor.py::test_no_stop_lacks_cause\n-          --deselect tests/test_doctor.py::test_every_attested_item_is_sealed\n-          --deselect tests/test_doctor.py::test_no_attested_item_is_empty\n+          python3 -m pytest tests -q --durations=5 -m 'not own_records'\n       - name: pytest end\n         if: steps.inherit.outputs.inherit != 'true'\n         run: echo \"PYTEST_END=$(date +%s)\" >> \"$GITHUB_ENV\"\n@@ -139,8 +133,8 @@ jobs:\n         with:\n           python-version: \"3.11\"\n       - run: pip install pytest jsonschema\n-      - name: doctor's five proofs\n-        run: python3 -m pytest tests/test_doctor.py -q -k \"every_gate_rejects or one_item_traversed_every_stage or no_commit_lacks_a_record or no_stop_lacks_cause or every_attested_item_is_sealed\"\n+      - name: the tests that read this repository's own records, the doctor's proofs among them\n+        run: python3 -m pytest tests -q -m own_records\n       - run: python3 bin/attavo doctor .\n \n   action-self-check:\ndiff --git a/attavo.toml b/attavo.toml\nindex 47c5df5..231e157 100644\n--- a/attavo.toml\n+++ b/attavo.toml\n@@ -37,7 +37,7 @@ retires = [\n [tests]\n select = \"python3 .attavo/bin/select-tests\"\n call_timeout_s = 240\n-run = \"xargs -r python3 -m pytest -q --deselect tests/test_doctor.py::test_every_gate_rejects --deselect tests/test_doctor.py::test_one_item_traversed_every_stage --deselect tests/test_doctor.py::test_no_commit_lacks_a_record --deselect tests/test_doctor.py::test_no_stop_lacks_cause --deselect tests/test_doctor.py::test_every_attested_item_is_sealed --deselect tests/test_doctor.py::test_no_attested_item_is_empty\"\n+run = \"x